        "Qianshuo (Aaron) Wang and Zhenning Wang. Synthetic comparison, not a multi-slot equilibrium.\n",
        "Run all cells. N=20, K=4, M=100, r=100ES, threshold=60, R=1, b=0.8v, lambda=1; seed 20260926; 1,000 independent batches, not dynamic rounds. The code runs 36 sensitivity scenarios. No external packages or downloads.\n"
      ]
